{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of HARD BULLET!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/bc476f0af94836a6cbb7711a2b1bf352.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/bc476f0af94836a6cbb7711a2b1bf352.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/bc476f0af94836a6cbb7711a2b1bf352.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for <strong>brutal and destructive</strong> combat where imagination is your weapon. HARD BULLET offers immersive action with endless enemies in <strong>RIDE Mode</strong>, custom rules in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong>, and skill tests in the <strong>Arena</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Inspired by classic Hong Kong action movies</strong>, bringing high-energy mature combat to your VR headset.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Unlockables:</strong> Dive into intense Ride runs to gain experience, money, and complete challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Interactions: </strong>Disarm enemies, steal weapons, use leg kicks, and perform one-handed reloads with our innovative physics setup.      </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox &amp; Arena:</strong> Use the ammo workshop, giant generator, and welding machine to build your own crazy weapons in this creative mode.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Body Damage:</strong> Experience realistic gore with body dismemberment, bullet holes, and blood fountains.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your path to brutal glory is about to begin.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slow Motion and Tricks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time, perform slow-motion jumps, leg kicks, dual-wield guns, and deliver powerful punches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/f1afeaf6689d3adafae095e9205183bf.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/f1afeaf6689d3adafae095e9205183bf.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/f1afeaf6689d3adafae095e9205183bf.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/3eef362f90aff7a1e47775f500092116.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/938c933bba9fd7173c4db2d8d761242a.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/938c933bba9fd7173c4db2d8d761242a.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/938c933bba9fd7173c4db2d8d761242a.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ragdolls and AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8818cb5223b0dfc48a98b79626629f7a.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8818cb5223b0dfc48a98b79626629f7a.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8818cb5223b0dfc48a98b79626629f7a.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disarm enemies, steal weapons, use leg kick, and perform one-handed reloads with our <strong>innovative physics setup.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab and punch</strong> enemies with your fists, throw them into the abyss, and <strong>use them as shields</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot their limbs off</strong> or put them into a hydraulic press \u2014 gory fun is on us.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/70d62db66656ed662f1bead972b69460.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=42 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/50bab8d11cff63ad1efeb3475417c0e0.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/50bab8d11cff63ad1efeb3475417c0e0.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/50bab8d11cff63ad1efeb3475417c0e0.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Sandbox Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who want to have their own brutal experience. Fight dwarves with giant pencils, build physics machines, and design torture chambers with deadly machines.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welding Tool</strong><br>Connect any in-game objects into one physics object! You can combine firearms, props, and living enemies to make your own grotesque weapons, machines, or monsters.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Ammo Workshop</strong><br>Use any in-game asset as a bullet! Change its speed, size, and rotation ability \u2014 charge your weapons with giant knives and swords to start a fantastic bloodbath.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Customization</strong><br>Create a giant you can climb up, dwarves, immortal zombies, or just change their fancy outfits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spawner Tool</strong><br>You can spawn any object from the Arenas, Lobby, and Sandbox levels. Unlimited grinders and Drills, dozens of props and enemies can be placed in seconds around you.    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/b6ac908b775eeb27e4be105b238f3b10.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/b6ac908b775eeb27e4be105b238f3b10.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/b6ac908b775eeb27e4be105b238f3b10.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/6d71bc1ecc310cb46f7027fbe66d5294.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=50 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pistols, Shotguns, SMGs, and Rifles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast collection of legendary firearms you can unlock during <strong>Early Access</strong>. Each gun has its unique sounds, damage, and fire modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8645a4f8cd9aa4313ed08a02935f16e8.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8645a4f8cd9aa4313ed08a02935f16e8.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8645a4f8cd9aa4313ed08a02935f16e8.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notice that these guns do not copy the exact design of real prototypes, but we tried to stick to reality as close as we could.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bladed and Blunt handy weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/7aac6c34091927004fcb62c4ac4a38e5.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/7aac6c34091927004fcb62c4ac4a38e5.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/7aac6c34091927004fcb62c4ac4a38e5.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapons \u2014 from tactical karambit and shovel to ancient Chinese swords and spears \u2014 are here and waiting for you. Don't forget some old rusty pipes and pitchforks!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, <strong>you can use any game object to fight enemies! Be creative! </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Gunplay modes: Arcade and Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've prepared two different gun modes so you can feel like a powerful action movie hero as well as a tactical modern fighter:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Mode</strong> brings everything you like in realistic shooters: <strong>hand reloads</strong>, cool mag-hits-mag tricks, <strong>slow-mo gun swaps,</strong>\u00a0and all the stunts you'll come up with. Use both hands to <strong>hold the handguard</strong> weapons to reduce recoil, and be fast and sharp to get out alive.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong> is the one we wanted to bring to VR. Your <strong>guns do autoreloads</strong> when you bring them closer to your waist, so both your hands can have one. Make crazy <strong>dual-wielding</strong> jumps, use two shotguns at a time, or show your gun-fu skills with dual-wielded pistols.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/4ac2ca8a6bb325ceb059e898031e6c62.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=44 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<br><strong>COMING SOON!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/e3c353015b5c3b0b81c6d0324cc509e7.avif?t=1776959926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras_big/e3c353015b5c3b0b81c6d0324cc509e7.webp?t=1776959926 width=1560 height=473 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1294760?t=1776959926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776959926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/176d21b2539590bdc9f7fd47c696fb5a61f94282/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776959926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/176d21b2539590bdc9f7fd47c696fb5a61f94282/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776959926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content.\r\n\r\nYou can TURN OFF gore, blood and other violent aspects in the Settings."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/488396f18519c1befac9084f27f8e74e.avif?t=1776959926\" width=614 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scan the QR code and join our <strong>Discord community\u00a0</strong>today. \ud83d\ude4c Come say hi to us!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of HARD BULLET!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/bc476f0af94836a6cbb7711a2b1bf352.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/bc476f0af94836a6cbb7711a2b1bf352.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/bc476f0af94836a6cbb7711a2b1bf352.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for <strong>brutal and destructive</strong> combat where imagination is your weapon. HARD BULLET offers immersive action with endless enemies in <strong>RIDE Mode</strong>, custom rules in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong>, and skill tests in the <strong>Arena</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Inspired by classic Hong Kong action movies</strong>, bringing high-energy mature combat to your VR headset.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Unlockables:</strong> Dive into intense Ride runs to gain experience, money, and complete challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Interactions: </strong>Disarm enemies, steal weapons, use leg kicks, and perform one-handed reloads with our innovative physics setup.      </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox &amp; Arena:</strong> Use the ammo workshop, giant generator, and welding machine to build your own crazy weapons in this creative mode.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Body Damage:</strong> Experience realistic gore with body dismemberment, bullet holes, and blood fountains.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your path to brutal glory is about to begin.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slow Motion and Tricks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time, perform slow-motion jumps, leg kicks, dual-wield guns, and deliver powerful punches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/f1afeaf6689d3adafae095e9205183bf.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/f1afeaf6689d3adafae095e9205183bf.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/f1afeaf6689d3adafae095e9205183bf.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/3eef362f90aff7a1e47775f500092116.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/938c933bba9fd7173c4db2d8d761242a.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/938c933bba9fd7173c4db2d8d761242a.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/938c933bba9fd7173c4db2d8d761242a.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ragdolls and AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8818cb5223b0dfc48a98b79626629f7a.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8818cb5223b0dfc48a98b79626629f7a.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8818cb5223b0dfc48a98b79626629f7a.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disarm enemies, steal weapons, use leg kick, and perform one-handed reloads with our <strong>innovative physics setup.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab and punch</strong> enemies with your fists, throw them into the abyss, and <strong>use them as shields</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot their limbs off</strong> or put them into a hydraulic press \u2014 gory fun is on us.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/70d62db66656ed662f1bead972b69460.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=42 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/50bab8d11cff63ad1efeb3475417c0e0.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/50bab8d11cff63ad1efeb3475417c0e0.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/50bab8d11cff63ad1efeb3475417c0e0.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Sandbox Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who want to have their own brutal experience. Fight dwarves with giant pencils, build physics machines, and design torture chambers with deadly machines.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welding Tool</strong><br>Connect any in-game objects into one physics object! You can combine firearms, props, and living enemies to make your own grotesque weapons, machines, or monsters.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Ammo Workshop</strong><br>Use any in-game asset as a bullet! Change its speed, size, and rotation ability \u2014 charge your weapons with giant knives and swords to start a fantastic bloodbath.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Customization</strong><br>Create a giant you can climb up, dwarves, immortal zombies, or just change their fancy outfits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spawner Tool</strong><br>You can spawn any object from the Arenas, Lobby, and Sandbox levels. Unlimited grinders and Drills, dozens of props and enemies can be placed in seconds around you.    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/b6ac908b775eeb27e4be105b238f3b10.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/b6ac908b775eeb27e4be105b238f3b10.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/b6ac908b775eeb27e4be105b238f3b10.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/6d71bc1ecc310cb46f7027fbe66d5294.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=50 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pistols, Shotguns, SMGs, and Rifles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast collection of legendary firearms you can unlock during <strong>Early Access</strong>. Each gun has its unique sounds, damage, and fire modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8645a4f8cd9aa4313ed08a02935f16e8.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8645a4f8cd9aa4313ed08a02935f16e8.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/8645a4f8cd9aa4313ed08a02935f16e8.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notice that these guns do not copy the exact design of real prototypes, but we tried to stick to reality as close as we could.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bladed and Blunt handy weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/7aac6c34091927004fcb62c4ac4a38e5.poster.avif?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/7aac6c34091927004fcb62c4ac4a38e5.webm?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/7aac6c34091927004fcb62c4ac4a38e5.mp4?t=1776959926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different weapons \u2014 from tactical karambit and shovel to ancient Chinese swords and spears \u2014 are here and waiting for you. Don't forget some old rusty pipes and pitchforks!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, <strong>you can use any game object to fight enemies! Be creative! </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Gunplay modes: Arcade and Tactical</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've prepared two different gun modes so you can feel like a powerful action movie hero as well as a tactical modern fighter:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Mode</strong> brings everything you like in realistic shooters: <strong>hand reloads</strong>, cool mag-hits-mag tricks, <strong>slow-mo gun swaps,</strong>\u00a0and all the stunts you'll come up with. Use both hands to <strong>hold the handguard</strong> weapons to reduce recoil, and be fast and sharp to get out alive.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode</strong> is the one we wanted to bring to VR. Your <strong>guns do autoreloads</strong> when you bring them closer to your waist, so both your hands can have one. Make crazy <strong>dual-wielding</strong> jumps, use two shotguns at a time, or show your gun-fu skills with dual-wielded pistols.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/4ac2ca8a6bb325ceb059e898031e6c62.webp?t=1776959926\" width=600 height=44 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<br><strong>COMING SOON!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras/e3c353015b5c3b0b81c6d0324cc509e7.avif?t=1776959926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/extras_big/e3c353015b5c3b0b81c6d0324cc509e7.webp?t=1776959926 width=1560 height=473 /></span></p>","developers":["GexagonVR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294760/5a3de56a29618dea25c3c3c930882df7cae0aca0/header.jpg?t=1776959926","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1294760/369425872/d2213b4983e6f4209d413f0026a276da09da6f2e/1750669916/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748447092","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1294760/369425872/d2213b4983e6f4209d413f0026a276da09da6f2e/1750669916/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748447092","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1294760/369425872/d2213b4983e6f4209d413f0026a276da09da6f2e/1750669916/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748447092","id":257147208,"name":"Hard Bullet 2025 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as